<p>Summons an icy wall of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 5, 5, 7, 7</acronym> length for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 6, 7, 8</acronym> turns. Ice walls are transparent, but block projectiles and enemies.</p><p>Ice walls also emit freezing cold, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">8.18, 11, 13, 15, 17</acronym> damage for each ice wall within radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 1, 1, 2</acronym> of an enemy, and with each wall giving a 25% chance to freeze an enemy. This cold cannot hurt the talent user or their allies.</p><p>Each point in cold drake talents also increases your cold resistance by 1%.</p>